  "intraday_notes": [
    {
      "id": "note-1f76f5b8f7b0",
      "replay_time": "2026-06-05 09:44:00 EDT",
      "text": "開盤偏TR 轉為開盤BO\n快拿到全天波幅\n嘗試Bear bar高點Sell limit拿低點",
      "created_at": "2026-09-30T07:39:25.749002+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-30T07:40:36.717611+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-c7f5f5aef5b3",
      "replay_time": "2026-06-05 10:14:00 EDT",
      "text": "連續3根HH，有可能直接10點反轉拿到上1/3\n但是空方很強還是可以嘗試\n如果實體Bull bar突破收盤離場或嘗試BE",
      "created_at": "2026-09-30T07:41:56.584989+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-30T07:43:10.766276+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-b7d8b826bf3d",
      "replay_time": "2026-06-05 10:34:00 EDT",
      "text": "測試50%空方嘗試拿second leg到前低失敗\n出現大Bull bar可能進入TTR或多方second leg\n這邊嘗試Sell limit拿1R",
      "created_at": "2026-09-30T07:45:15.062369+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-30T07:45:15.062376+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-56a256dc5853",
      "replay_time": "2026-06-05 10:54:00 EDT",
      "text": "沒成交，TTR 低點Buy limit",
      "created_at": "2026-09-30T07:46:46.011948+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-30T07:46:46.011957+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-5717ff22db94",
      "replay_time": "2026-06-05 11:09:00 EDT",
      "text": "比較強的K線圖破，可以離場或是嘗試BE",
      "created_at": "2026-09-30T07:48:53.822446+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-30T07:48:53.822452+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-b44743ca20e6",
      "replay_time": "2026-06-05 11:19:00 EDT",
      "text": "突破今低沒有FT有機會測50%或上1/3",
      "created_at": "2026-09-30T07:49:20.974759+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-30T07:49:20.974767+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-eadae3f921c8",
      "replay_time": "2026-06-05 11:39:00 EDT",
      "text": "這裡打到SL",
      "created_at": "2026-09-30T07:49:46.394531+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-30T07:49:46.394538+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-283ce277866b",
      "replay_time": "2026-06-05 11:39:00 EDT",
      "text": "等12點看有沒有小結構反轉",
      "created_at": "2026-09-30T07:52:26.884365+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-30T07:52:26.884374+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-ad2cce5c85be",
      "replay_time": "2026-06-05 12:09:00 EDT",
      "text": "前低BO的空方拿到大停損1R",
      "created_at": "2026-09-30T07:55:20.447770+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-30T07:55:20.447777+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-32a7b3e8e189",
      "replay_time": "2026-06-05 12:34:00 EDT",
      "text": "Bear TTR BO拿到2R",
      "created_at": "2026-09-30T07:56:11.102124+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-30T07:56:11.102131+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-65f30d9322ad",
      "replay_time": "2026-06-05 12:54:00 EDT",
      "text": "第一次出現連續收高Bull bar\n這邊高機率還是下半區震盪\n1. Buy liimit賭反轉到50%~下1/3 大概可以1~1.5R\n2. 等半區出來Sell limit拿下半區\n3. 空方反轉後Buy limit 拿半區",
      "created_at": "2026-09-30T07:58:08.363715+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-30T08:00:18.827000+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-7fdc146bc6ab",
      "replay_time": "2026-06-05 14:06:00 EDT",
      "text": "這裡上下都拿到TP，應該繼續半區震盪因為上半場波幅太大",
      "created_at": "2026-09-30T08:02:42.452238+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-30T08:02:42.452245+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "note-0e0b59c0ce17",
      "replay_time": "2026-06-05 15:59:00 EDT",
      "text": "結果再次TR BO後拿到3R全天超級大波幅",
      "created_at": "2026-09-30T08:04:26.264395+00:00",
      "updated_at": "2026-09-30T08:04:26.264406+00:00"
    }
  ],
